  "title": {
   "en": "Isshou Watashi no Joshu de ite!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "一生わたしの助手でいて！"
   },
   {
    "en": "Be my Assistant for Life!"
   },
   {
    "id": "Jadilah Asistenku Seumur Hidup!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"The relationship between a detective and their assistant is not unlike romance!\"\n\nDue to his natural tendency to assist others (a \"helper type\" personality that makes him constantly want to lend a hand), Mitomo Tasuku had always lived in the shadows. To break out of this, he made it his life's mission to \"become number one.\" However, at the high school he transfers to, he encounters three detective girls, who happen to be his rivals from elementary school with whom he formed a detective club together. Thus begins Tasuku's fierce battle for the top detective spot! However... these girls seem to harbor passionate feelings of a different kind...!?",
   "ja": "持ち前の助手体質(つい手助けをしてしまう体質)のせいで日陰者だった御供助玖は、その状況を打破するため「トップになる」ことを最重要課題として生きてきた。しかし、転校先の高校で出会った探偵少女3人は、小学校の頃に探偵団を一緒にやっていた因縁の相手だった! 探偵(トップ)の座をかけた助玖の熱い戦いが始まる!! ただ‥‥彼女たちは違う意味で熱い想いを秘めていて‥‥!?"
  },
